# Article Master — frozen format + teaching refs

## Do not change format unprompted

**Never** invent / reorder / rename columns, season layout, or Excel grouping on your own
when regenerating previews or shipping updates. Match the locked bedsheet FINAL style
unless the user explicitly asks to change the format.

Locked download / FINAL-merge layout:
- Attrs in `CANONICAL_ARTICLE_MASTER_COLUMNS` order
- Prices expand to `MRP (season)` / `Ex-Mill (season)` / `PTR (season)`
- Older seasons Excel-grouped; **latest season stays visible**
- Bed taught seasons: **SS-25, SS-26, AW-26**
- Towel taught seasons so far: **AW-25, AW-26** (extra seasons only when a source sheet exists)

## Canonical columns (fixed order — never invent others)

Category, Product, Brand, Size, TC, Units, BS Size, Pillow Size, Color, Pillow Stitching Style, Print Style, Blend, Packing, Bale Pack Size, MRP, AWD Mark up on Exmill, Ex-Mill, Proposed Customer Discount, Retailer Margin, PTR

**Dropped (Bed):** No of Design, Color (booking noise — excluded on Bed upload).

**Bath / Towel:** keep **Color** (from Shade) after Pillow Size; White ≠ Assorted.

**Alias:** Proposed Customer Discount ≡ Perceived (same field; display name is Proposed Customer Discount).

Defined in `article_master_routes.py` as `CANONICAL_ARTICLE_MASTER_COLUMNS`.

