## Sticky schema attrs (gap-fill / never blank-wipe)

Pillow Size, Pillow Stitching Style, Print Style, Blend, Packing, **Color** (Bath; Shade→Color)

## Bath / Towel teaching

- Category **Bath**; identity **Brand + Size + Color + Product**
- Size codes → Hand Towel / Face Towel / Bath Towel / Ladies Towel / Pool Towel / Towel Set / Bath Mat / Gym Towel / 91x100 / Large / Extra Large / Double Extra Large; sets → Hand Towel Set of 2, Face Towel Set of 3
- Shade → **Color**; Assorted/Asst → Assorted NN (zero-pad); Jacquarad→Jacquard; WHITE→White
- PVC (Shade or Description) → Packing `PVC bag Pkg`; `(L)`/`Pkg` ignore — keep PVC/latest sibling
- Product: Bathmat… → **Bathmat Antiskid**; Towelling Fabric / Terry Towel / … as-is
- Brands: Bd White→BD White, Lepord→Leopard, Eco Stripe, Gym Towel, Huk A Buk; Flora Bathrobe / Tulip Bathrobe kept
- Drop: Description, SL NO, Delivery Date, Colours/Total Colours, AWD order, Qty in Bales
- Pack Sizes ≡ Bale Pack Size
- Refs: `AW-25 Towel Booking Sheet.xlsx`, `AW-26 Towel Phase-2 Booking Sheet.xlsx`

## TOB teaching

- Category **TOB** (incl. Bed in a Bag / BIAB / `Bed in a Bga`→Bed in a Bag)
- Identity **Brand + Size + Product + Color** (Color empty — option counts ignored)
- Size as-is; Brand as-is (trim)
- Quality + Ply + Weight → **Blend** (Polyster→Polyester; SNL-PLY→Single Ply; weight as-is)
- Print/Dyed/Weave → Print Style
- Retail Mark down → Retailer Margin; AWD MD → AWD Markup; Bale Pack Size → Pack Sizes
- Drop: MOQ, Booking Qnty, Dyed/Printed Option, Print Colorways, Delivery Months
- Ref: `AW-26 TOB Revised Booking Sheet_23.06.2026.xlsx`

## Pillow teaching

- Category **Pillow** (not TOB Pillow)
- Identity **Brand + Size + Product**
- Size as-is; Unit → Units; Print/Dyed/Weave → Print Style; Option drop
- Quality + Weight → Blend (Polyster→Polyester; Alovera→Aloe Vera; weight as-is)
- Brand: Comfot→Comfort; Product as-is (trim/spaces)
- Margins / Pack / drops same pattern as TOB
- Ref: `Pillow  Booking Sheet_05.05.2026.xlsx`

## Display order within a brand

Bed: Single → Double → King (`sort_articles_for_display`).
Bath: Face → Hand → Ladies → Bath → Pool → sets → L/XL/XXL.

## Perceived / margins

**Proposed Customer Discount** ≡ Perceived (same field). Display as % (0.4 → 40%).
Distributor Margin = AWD / Mark up on Exmill.
